# Epic — Instructional Design

> **For epic-executor:** This epic will be executed wave-by-wave.
> **Required pre-reading by every wave's build subagent:**
> 1. Charter: `automatiklabs/docs/educational-system/CHARTER.md`
> 2. Context: `docs/educational-system/context/instructional-design.md`
> 3. Skill: `automatiklabs-doctrine`

## Goal

Produce and publish the canonical competency catalog (`competency_catalog_v1.yaml`) and the first set of `learning_design_doc.yaml` course files for the "Empresa com IA Humanizada" Formação, enabling Content Production and Assessment Engine to begin Fase 1 work.

## Scope

- Creates and version-controls `competency_catalog_v1.yaml` in git.
- Produces `learning_design_doc.yaml` for each course in the first Formação (all 3 Pilares).
- Defines the `fase1-cube-cells.yaml` prioritization artifact for Curriculum Orchestration.
- Publishes `competency-acceptance-criteria.md` v1 (blocking dependency for Pedagogical QA).
- Does NOT write migrations, generate lesson prose, or build UI components.

