## Notes for the future executor agent

- This area produces YAML files in git, not database rows. Output is file creation + PR.
- The first deliverable is `competency-acceptance-criteria.md` (INSTR-01) — every other area is blocked until this exists. Treat it as P0.
- The `competency_catalog_v1.yaml` is seeded into the DB via migration `00013_competencies.sql` (owned by Schema Extensions). Do not attempt DB inserts directly.
- Starred skills (`backward-design`, `bloom-calibrator`) do not yet exist. Apply these frameworks manually using Charter Part II as the reference.
